  "summary_en": "Law-firm blog post commenting on Oman's draft National AI Policy, open for consultation until 28 August 2024. It explains the policy is non-binding, principle-based and distinguishes providers from deployers. The author endorses a wait-and-see approach but urges amending the Personal Data Protection Law for profiling and automated decisions.",
